# Update AGENTS.md every session

`AGENTS.md` is the project index. Read **Project briefing** first. Do not scan the whole tree unless the briefing is missing the answer.

After any meaningful change in this session, update `AGENTS.md` before you finish:

- **Current state** — what exists now (routes, schema, env, SDK, backend objects).
- **Map** — new or moved paths only; drop stale rows.
- **Session log** — one dated bullet of what changed and why.

Leave the Next.js (`BEGIN:nextjs-agent-rules`) and InsForge (`INSFORGE:START`) blocks untouched.

Backend work uses `npx -y @insforge/cli` and the InsForge skills. Never hardcode keys.
